{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261021/photo/bkn-20261021085728263-1021_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261021110117\"/><p>部分蜂巢殘留在大廈一單簷篷上。(馬竟峯攝)</p><p>今日(21日)早上8時39分，銅鑼灣禮頓道32至34號星華大廈一住戶報案，指懷疑樓上單位有人用火燒毀蜂巢，期間部分起火蜂巢跌落其單位外的冷氣機頂部。人員接報到場前火勢已熄滅，部分蜂巢殘留在大廈3樓一單簷篷上，幸事件未釀成火警，經調查後列「誤會」處理。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-21T03:20:18.658591+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":155,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T00:57:28+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-21T03:17:51.895875+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-21T03:17:51.895875+00:00","content_hash":"4f1473e52f78b735f6bee42b2c0675a6bfdcd4af71b1d349948a1c8fd217d6f1","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}